Subject: [PATCH] Phase 3 - AuraLite-Native reference pack: the format's
 executable spec

packs/AuraLite-Native covers every grammar feature of pack.aurapack API
level 1 once: 8 sections, raster + compute + history + external passes,
bool/select/slider/const options, screen tabs, explicit stages. Gate:
packlint 0 errors / 0 warnings (also --strict --null-device); the pack
suite loads it from disk and executes its own frame on the NULL device
via a pack-backed provider - 38 commands, 13 barriers, 40560 work groups,
0 contract violations, shipped GLSL validated. Host gate: 985/0, 7/7.
